{"id":1746,"date":"2025-09-17T09:01:55","date_gmt":"2025-09-17T09:01:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/atomic-temporary-248635850.wpcomstaging.com\/?page_id=11"},"modified":"2026-10-23T10:16:09","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T16:16:09","slug":"parties","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/thebotspot.org\/parties\/","title":{"rendered":"Parties"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Activities<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/samgage100.softvenceomega.com\/\"><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHome \/<br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/thebotspot.org\/index.php\/parties\/\"><br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOur Activities<br \/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Our Activities<\/h2>\n<h2>Explore all the fun at our downtown provo family robot arcade<br \/>\n<\/h2>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/thebotspot.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/05e57-img_9583.jpg?resize=2048%2C1536\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Robot Battle Arenas<\/h2>\n<p>Take control of a weaponized robot and face off against friends in one of our two custom-built arenas. Up to 8 players per arena for epic showdowns!<\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/thebotspot.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/4dade-img_9461-scaled-1.jpg?resize=2560%2C1440\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Classic Arcade Games<\/h2>\n<p>Enjoy timeless favorites like air hockey, foosball, and more, perfect for quick matches and friendly competition.<\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2223\" height=\"2684\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/thebotspot.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/85c22-20251014_214500.jpg?resize=2223%2C2684\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Snacks &amp; Refreshments<\/h2>\n<p>Refuel between games with chips, soft drinks, and snacks that keep the energy going.<\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"2730\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/thebotspot.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/2042c-img_9925.jpg?resize=1536%2C2730\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Birthday Parties &amp; Events<\/h2>\n<p>Celebrate in style! Our arcade is the perfect spot for birthdays, group outings, and team events with fun packages to fit your needs.<\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2730\" height=\"1536\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/thebotspot.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/ff09c-img_9470.jpg?resize=2730%2C1536\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Family &amp; Friends Nights<\/h2>\n<p>Make it a night to remember with activities designed for couples, families, and friends to bond, laugh, and compete together.<\/p>\n<p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/atomic-temporary-248635850.wpcomstaging.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/IMG_5611.jpg?ssl=1\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n<h2>Tournaments &amp; Challenges<\/h2>\n<p>Test your skills in our regular robot battles and arcade challenges\u2014bragging rights await!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Activities Home \/ Our Activities Our Activities Explore all the fun at our downtown provo family robot arcade Robot Battle Arenas Take control of a weaponized robot and face off against friends in one of our two custom-built arenas. Up to 8 players per arena for epic showdowns! Classic Arcade Games Enjoy timel